<section class='home-hero' data-home-hero aria-labelledby='home-hero-title'>
  <div class='home-hero__stage'>
    <div class='home-hero__media' aria-hidden='true'>
      <div class='home-hero__production'>
        <img
          class='home-hero__production-image'
          src='/src/assets/images/home/hero/hero-production.webp'
          width='1920'
          height='2160'
          alt=''
          fetchpriority='high'
          decoding='async'
        />
      </div>

      <picture class='home-hero__ship'>
        <source
          media='(max-width: 1023px)'
          srcset='/src/assets/images/home/hero/hero-ship-mobile.webp'
        />

        <img
          class='home-hero__ship-image'
          src='/src/assets/images/home/hero/hero-ship.webp'
          width='1920'
          height='2160'
          alt=''
          fetchpriority='high'
          decoding='async'
        />
      </picture>

      <img
        class='home-hero__chain-poster'
        src='/images/home/hero/chain/1.webp'
        width='1280'
        height='1280'
        alt=''
        fetchpriority='high'
        decoding='async'
      />

      <canvas class='home-hero__chain-canvas' width='1280' height='1280'></canvas>

      <img
        class='home-hero__mobile-anchor'
        src='/src/assets/images/home/hero/hero-mobile-anchor.png'
        width='640'
        height='1853'
        alt=''
        fetchpriority='high'
        decoding='async'
      />

      <div class='home-hero__production-shadow'></div>
      <div class='home-hero__mobile-shadow'></div>
    </div>

    <div class='home-hero__container'>
      <h1 id='home-hero-title' class='home-hero__title'>
        Современное
        <br />
        <span>производство</span>
        <br />
        цепей для
        <br />
        любых задач
      </h1>

      <div class='home-hero__content'>
        <p class='home-hero__caption'>
          «Завод Красный Якорь»&nbsp;— производитель цепей и&nbsp;комплектующих для разных отраслей
        </p>

        <a class='home-hero__link' href='#catalog'>
          <span class='home-hero__link-text'>Все отрасли</span>

          <svg
            class='home-hero__link-icon'
            width='28'
            height='28'
            viewBox='0 0 28 28'
            aria-hidden='true'
          >
            <path d='M6 6L22 22M9 22H22V9' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type='module' src='/src/scripts/home-hero.js'></script>
